(iii) A statement specifying the nature of the violation;
(iv) A description of the remedial measures necessary to bring the action or inaction into compliance with the permit, the approved site plan or this article and the date for the completion of such remedial action;
(v) A statement of the penalty or penalties that may be assessed against the person to whom the notice of violation is directed; and,
